  <decision id="D2_MODE" name="D2_MODE">
    <description>D2: mode of the battery, priority from top to bottom (force / low / prot = the latches above, ff = force_full_from_pv is on). 0.77-py: one bank (both stacks parallel), charged only up to the Pytes limit: no top hold window any more, SoC 100 % of the Pytes BMS = FULL.</description>
